The Amiga UNIX (AMIX) 2.1c system headers, libraries, startup objects, X11
and kernel relink kit at patch level 2a, as published in amigaux/amix-system
under Amiga Corporation's approval, in /opt/m68k-amix-sysroot.  Absolute
links are made relative to the sysroot, so nothing points into the host.

The AMIX cross compilers (amix-gcc-27, amix-gcc-14) build and link against it.
